# ACE is local-only

ACE was removed from git (source, icon, preview GIF and data builder) because it
is built from private `Icon_*.png` keyframes. The files still live on disk and
are gitignored; keep them that way.

- **Never** `git add`, commit, or push (including via bulk `git add -A`, or
  `git add -f` on an ignored path):
  - `keyboards/ydkb/athena75_rgb_advanced/src/app/ace/` — program, icon and the
    `keyframes/` PNG inputs.
  - `keyboards/ydkb/athena75_rgb_advanced/src/app/tools/build_ace_data.py`.
  - `keyboards/ydkb/athena75_rgb_advanced/artifacts/apps/ace.app` (and
    `apps/hidden/`) — embeds the ~3 MB QGF derived from those PNGs.
  - `keyboards/ydkb/athena75_rgb_advanced/docs/apps/ace.gif`.
- Building/flashing ACE locally is fine: `build_app.sh ace` still works, it just
  produces ignored output.
- Do not reintroduce ACE into tracked docs or scripts (`readme.md`,
  `docs/*.md`, `artifacts/apps/readme.txt`, `tools/record_readme_gifs.sh`,
  `tools/sim_record.py`).
